{"id":"d07bc20b7cf43ad2","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-kucera.md","title":"随机序列的某个尾属于正测度有效闭类","display":"thm-kucera — 随机序列的某个尾属于正测度有效闭类","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-kucera","aliases":["20-thm-kucera"],"display":"thm-kucera — 随机序列的某个尾属于正测度有效闭类","chapter":"11","section":"11.3","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Theorem 11.3.2（保留证明的较强尾序列结论）","source_printed_pages":[192],"source_pdf_pages":[223],"depends_on":["[[20-df-closed-class]]","[[20-df-random]]","[[20-df-cantor-measure]]","[[20-df-tail-shift]]","[[20-lem-effective-prefix-free-cover]]","[[20-thm-prefix-product-measure]]","[[20-df-teq]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-kucera"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-kucera</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-kucera — 随机序列的某个尾属于正测度有效闭类"},{"key":"chapter","html":"11"},{"key":"section","html":"11.3"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Theorem 11.3.2（保留证明的较强尾序列结论）"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>192</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>223</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"238731f42b452fa7\" href=\"?note=238731f42b452fa7\" title=\"20-df-random\">20-df-random</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"978bb51599bc5702\" href=\"?note=978bb51599bc5702\" title=\"20-df-cantor-measure\">20-df-cantor-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"830fee4940630058\" href=\"?note=830fee4940630058\" title=\"20-df-tail-shift\">20-df-tail-shift</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"6b1ea16104a72d78\" href=\"?note=6b1ea16104a72d78\" title=\"20-lem-effective-prefix-free-cover\">20-lem-effective-prefix-free-cover</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"6012ed8c9d9b861e\" href=\"?note=6012ed8c9d9b861e\" title=\"20-thm-prefix-product-measure\">20-thm-prefix-product-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"3dd875417abdd49f\" href=\"?note=3dd875417abdd49f\" title=\"20-df-teq\">20-df-teq</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(C)\">\\(\\operatorname{Pi01Class}(C)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(C)&gt;0\">\\(\\mu(C)&gt;0\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X)\">\\(\\operatorname{MLRandom}(X)\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"b73290a0af01d44f\" href=\"?note=b73290a0af01d44f\" title=\"20-df-closed-class\">20-df-closed-class</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"238731f42b452fa7\" href=\"?note=238731f42b452fa7\" title=\"20-df-random\">20-df-random</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"978bb51599bc5702\" href=\"?note=978bb51599bc5702\" title=\"20-df-cantor-measure\">20-df-cantor-measure</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"830fee4940630058\" href=\"?note=830fee4940630058\" title=\"20-df-tail-shift\">20-df-tail-shift</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"6b1ea16104a72d78\" href=\"?note=6b1ea16104a72d78\" title=\"20-lem-effective-prefix-free-cover\">20-lem-effective-prefix-free-cover</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"6012ed8c9d9b861e\" href=\"?note=6012ed8c9d9b861e\" title=\"20-thm-prefix-product-measure\">20-thm-prefix-product-measure</a>。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-14\" data-note=\"3dd875417abdd49f\" href=\"?note=3dd875417abdd49f\" title=\"20-df-teq\">20-df-teq</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kucera}\\vdash\n\\exists k\\in\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{tail}_k(X)\\in C\\land\\operatorname{tail}_k(X)\\equiv_T X].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}kucera}\\vdash\n\\exists k\\in\\omega\\ [\\operatorname{tail}_k(X)\\in C\\land\\operatorname{tail}_k(X)\\equiv_T X].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>为补集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 取 c.e. 前缀自由 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span>；因 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(U)&lt;1\">\\(\\mu(U)&lt;1\\)</span>，它不含空串。选有理数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(U)&lt;q&lt;1\">\\(\\mu(U)&lt;q&lt;1\\)</span>，拼接幂覆盖 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_n\">\\(U_n\\)</span> 的测度至多 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"q^n\">\\(q^n\\)</span>，有效取子列成为 ML 检验。随机 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\">\\(X\\)</span> 逃出某一幂；令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\ge1\">\\(n\\ge1\\)</span> 是它首次不属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_n\">\\(U_n\\)</span> 的次数。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n=1\">\\(n=1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in C\">\\(X\\in C\\)</span>；否则它属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U_{n-1}\">\\(U_{n-1}\\)</span>，删去唯一的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n-1\">\\(n-1\\)</span> 段代码前缀，剩余尾不能再属于 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span>，因而在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\">\\(C\\)</span>。删掉有限前缀保留度。存在有理上界和尾移位置不意味着能从任意类索引统一判定其正测度或统一找到位置。</p>\n<p>来源：Theorem 11.3.2（保留证明的较强尾序列结论）；印刷页 192；PDF 第 223 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-closed-class]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-random","status":"resolved","id":"238731f42b452fa7","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-random]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-cantor-measure","status":"resolved","id":"978bb51599bc5702","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-cantor-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-tail-shift","status":"resolved","id":"830fee4940630058","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-tail-shift]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-effective-prefix-free-cover","status":"resolved","id":"6b1ea16104a72d78","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-effective-prefix-free-cover]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-prefix-product-measure","status":"resolved","id":"6012ed8c9d9b861e","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-prefix-product-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-teq","status":"resolved","id":"3dd875417abdd49f","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-teq]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-closed-class","status":"resolved","id":"b73290a0af01d44f","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-closed-class]]；see [[20-df-random]]；see [[20-df-cantor-measure]]；see [[2